{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1417928-how-can-non-sidereal-fix-the-mask-constellation","id":1417928,"title":"How can non-Sidereal fix the Mask constellation?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-12T14:53:57-07:00","id":1417928,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> How can non-Sidereal fix the Mask constellation?","content":"If non-Sidereal Exalted wanted to fix the Mask constellation, how could they go about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T15:04:16-07:00","id":1417930,"title":"","content":"Hammer and nails.<br /> <br /> How would a Sidereal fix the Mask?<br /> <br /> Is the Mask even broken in 3E?<br /> <br /> Can you even break a constellation in 3E?<br /> <br /> Does &quot;fixing the Mask&quot; mean &quot;undoing Arcane Fate&quot; or does it mean &quot;restoring the constellation for the purposes of Sidereal Astrology&quot;? Or both?<br /> <br /> Because undoing Arcane Fate and fixing Astrology are things I see Solars approaching in two very different ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T15:06:57-07:00","id":1417931,"title":"","content":"Celestial Duct Tape","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T06:18:30-07:00","id":1418035,"title":"","content":"Hmm... a constellation is made of stars in a pattern. A broken constellation would have to have missing and/or miss-aligned stars.<br /> <br /> So...<br /> <br /> You'd want two Dawn castes, I think. One archer to shoot down any stars that are in the wrong places, and one brawler to yeet a couple gods of light into the sky to replace the missing stars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T16:44:58-07:00","id":1418118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1417928-how-can-non-sidereal-fix-the-mask-constellation?p=1417930#post1417930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does &quot;fixing the Mask&quot; mean &quot;undoing Arcane Fate&quot; or does it mean &quot;restoring the constellation for the purposes of Sidereal Astrology&quot;? Or both?<br /> <br /> Because undoing Arcane Fate and fixing Astrology are things I see Solars approaching in two very different ways.</div> </div> </div> </div>The goal is to undo Arcane Fate so Sidereals can't hide from the Mortals &amp; Exalted of Creation. I personally see the two results intertwined, but I am very curious on what 2 ways you envision.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T19:19:53-07:00","id":1418130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1417928-how-can-non-sidereal-fix-the-mask-constellation?p=1418118#post1418118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The goal is to undo Arcane Fate so Sidereals can't hide from the Mortals &amp; Exalted of Creation. I personally see the two results intertwined, but I am very curious on what 2 ways you envision.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Technically, that wouldn't be fixing either, as the &quot;breaking&quot; - as 2e describes that idea and it might get as much of a revamp as the Lunar Bond - seems to be about what previously was an option turning into a permanent/always on effect over the whole of the Fivescore Fellowship. Making it unavailable would be <i>inverting the problem</i>, not really solving it, i'd say.<br /> <br /> Making it optional and something the sidereal must actively pursue/weave upon itself, that might actually fit as actually &quot;fixing the mask&quot;.<br /> <br /> Again, supposing the conceit of a Broken Mask constelation as an explanation for Arcane Fate even is a thing in 3rd edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-13-2020, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T00:54:33-07:00","id":1418154,"title":"","content":"Yeah, we don\u2019t know that the breaking of the Mask is responsible for Arcane Fate in 3E; we don\u2019t even know that the Mask <i>is</i> broken. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s a little akin to asking how a character can bring about redeeming an Abyssal into a Solar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T02:50:25-07:00","id":1418164,"title":"","content":"That said, the fact it is an assumption specific to 2e lore that has not been confirmed (or denied) in 3rd edition does not impede you as ST of making it a fact in your games for the sake of play.<br /> <br /> I did do so in a 2e Sidereals game years ago - and irony of ironies, it wasn't really to explore the fixing of things as plot, but because i wanted to explain one of the PCs possessing the Forgotten Blade and knowing so, even though in its original presentation (in the Invisible Fortress adventures) it's very much of an unknown factor &amp; mystery.<br /> <br /> In the case, i decided that when the Mask broke, 24 fragments were lost in Creation, each one taking a form mirroring the other constelations though with a twist representative of the Mask themes.<br /> The PC's &quot;forgotten blade&quot; was actually the Sword fragment and i remember considering the Emissary was the Sorcerer fragment (the fragments manifesting as objects, people and more), among other things.<br /> <br /> Yes, the PCs managed to collect a number of them, but also to meet with a most impressive lot of discoveries and trouble along the way, some of which that might still lead them, or some major figures of the Fivescore Fellowship, to ruin.<br /> <br /> Also, finding the fragments was far from the only problem in the proccess to reforging the Mask, as they would eventually find out the Sidereals' extensive preparations for the Usurpation were far from the only thing to blame for that in the first place. Other hidden things were at play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-14-2020, 05:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T03:10:34-07:00","id":1418166,"title":"","content":"So, in our chronicle; one of the player characters is a Lunar that has been gifted the Forgotten Blade. The GM has told the player that by holding the blade they can see any damage caused by it. This has been revealing as additional scars and thing have been found on people and we are unpicking what has actually happened to it characters. <br /> <br /> Part of that was seeing a giant scar in the sky across the Mask, inferring that he forgotten blade was involved, if not outright responsible for that damage. <br /> <br /> The play is currently planning on nursing the Distaff (the artifact they started with) and eventually freeing it of its cocoon to birth a new artifact and supplement the Forgotten blade by using the distaff to weave new memories into the places where the forgotten blade cuts. <br /> <br /> His current goal is to fix the mask using this combination of artifacts and a lot of sorcery and necromancy. <br /> <br /> We\u2019ll see how that goes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(10chars)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2721-elkovash","name":"Elkovash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"528"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T09:04:45-07:00","id":1418199,"title":"","content":"Sure sounds like a \u201csubtle alteration to the metaphysics of the entire cosmos\u201d to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}